      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Pleasant_Hill%2C_Mississippi",
      "category": "history",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 5,
      "text": "When incorporated, Pleasant Hill boasted several stores, two churches, and a Masonic lodge, reflecting a bustling small town.",
